id":65583054,"type":0,"score":0,"score_2":0,"recommend":0,"postdate":"2026-08-09 20:53","subject":"","alterinfo":"","content":"[quote][pid=877910766,47341103,1]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=43308954]麻烦提拉[/uid] (2026-08-09 20:41):[/b]<br/>要不你替高通把5g专利费交一下？[/quote]<br/><br/>你大概没脑子?高通不造手机，谁听说高通交5G专利费的，你莫不是逗比","lou":6,"content_length":68,"from_client":"0 /","postdatetimestamp":1786280009},"7":{"pid":877911758,"fid":436,"tid":47341103,"authorid":65583054,"type":0,"score":0,"score_2":0,"recommend":0,"postdate":"2026-08-09 20:54","subject":"","alterinfo":"","content":"[quote][pid=877911023,47341103,1]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67162805]江山别离[/uid] (2026-08-09 20:45):[/b]<br/>有一说一，高通卖芯片给华为并没有违反制裁，美国对于低端芯片的策略一直是倾销占市场，制裁的是高端芯片。<br/>别偷换概念了。[s:ac:哭笑][/quote]<br/>高通卖给华为的骁龙8+不是高端芯片?<br/>你要不看看mate50用的啥呢?<br/>你对华为的手机都不了解你确定你不是串子?","lou":7,"content_length":102,"from_client":"0 /","postdatetimestamp":1786280098},"8":{"pid":877911878,"fid":436,"tid":47341103,"authorid":61061747,"type":0,"score":14,"score_2":0,"recommend":0,"postdate":"2026-08-09 20:56","subject":"","alterinfo":"","content":"卖一颗阉割版4G芯片搭售一堆垃圾低端，高通爽爆了好吧<br/>华子被制裁英特尔一直也卖芯片给他，amd不卖是不想吗，是它的游说能力没英特尔强<br/>有钱不赚王八蛋？","lou":8,"content_length":141,"from_client":"8 Android","postdatetimestamp":1786280192},"9":{"pid":877911997,"fid":436,"tid":47341103,"authorid":67183685,"type":0,"score":0,"score_2":0,"recommend":0,"postdate":"2026-08-09 20:58","subject":"","alterinfo":"","content":"磕一个哪里够啊，没有高通的支持，华为怕是直接倒闭了","lou":9,"content_length":50,"from_client":"8 Android","postdatetimestamp":1786280293},"10":{"pid":877914915,"fid":436,"tid":47341103,"authorid":6450404,"type":0,"score":6,"score_2":0,"recommend":0,"postdate":"2026-08-09 21:38","subject":"","alterinfo":"","content":"高通顶着P的制裁危险，那是允许的，不允许卖5G芯片，所以卖的都是4G芯片。Intel当初也是被允许的，去年又不允许了。<br/>不被允许卖华为芯片的是英伟达，AMD和联发科，也没人敢顶着制裁风险卖给华为","lou":10,"content_length":179,"from_client":"0 /","postdatetimestamp":1786282715},"11":{"pid":877915694,"fid":436,"tid":47341103,"authorid":65583054,"type":0,"score":0,"score_2":0,"recommend":0,"postdate":"2026-08-09 21:49","subject":"","alterinfo":"","content":"[quote][pid=877911878,47341103,1]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=61061747]starswar3[/uid] (2026-08-09 20:56):[/b]<br/>卖一颗阉割版4G芯片搭售一堆垃圾低端，高通爽爆了好吧<br/>华子被制裁英特尔一直也卖芯片给他，amd不卖是不想吗，是它的游说能力没英特尔强<br/>有钱不赚王八蛋？[/quote]<br/>乘他病要他命，不管华为看他死，垄断安卓芯片市场  ?<br/>想方设法绕过制裁，定制开发4芯片，卖给华为挣点快钱  √<br/><br/>高通真乃国际主义战士","lou":11,"content_length":123,"from_client":"0 /","postdatetimestamp":1786283344},"12":{"pid":877916580,"fid":436,"tid":47341103,"authorid":62305029,"type":0,"score":2,"score_2":0,"recommend":0,"postdate":"2026-08-09 22:01","subject":"","alterinfo":"","content":"[b]Reply to [pid=877911758,47341103,1]Reply[/pid] Post by [uid=65583054]znen766[/uid] (2026-08-09 20:54)[/b]你是不是不知道有个东西叫供货许可。","lou":12,"content_length":64,"reply_to":877911758,"from_client":"0 /","postdatetimestamp":1786284068},"13":{"pid":877916646,"fid":436,"tid":47341103,"authorid":60375773,"type":0,"score":6,"score_2":0,"recommend":0,"postdate":"2026-08-09 22:02","subject":"","alterinfo":"","content":"哪来的司马野狗","lou":13,"content_length":14,"from_client":"31 /","postdatetimestamp":1786284122},"14":{"pid":877916774,"fid":436,"tid":47341103,"authorid":629136,"type":0,"score":0,"score_2":0,"recommend":0,"postdate":"2026-08-09 22:03","subject":"","alterinfo":"","content":"[quote][pid=877911758,47341103,1]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=65583054]znen766[/uid] (2026-08-09 20:54):[/b]<br/><br/>高通卖给华为的骁龙8+不是高端芯片?<br/>你要不看看mate50用的啥呢?<br/>你对华为的手机都不了解你确定你不是串子?[/quote]<br/><br/>落后安卓旗舰两代","lou":14,"content_length":21,"reply_to":877911758,"from_client":"0 /","postdatetimestamp":1786284219},"15":{"pid":877916849,"fid":436,"tid":47341103,"authorid":163212,"type":0,"score":3,"score_2":0,"recommend":0,"postdate":"2026-08-09 22:04","subject":"","alterinfo":"","content":"[quote][pid=877911653,47341103,1]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=65583054]znen766[/uid] (2026-08-09 20:53):[/b]<br/><br/>你大概没脑子?高通不造手机，谁听说高通交5G专利费的，你莫不是逗比[/quote]<br/><br/>你是不是没脑子啊？高通基带不用华为的5g专利？","lou":15,"content_length":49,"from_client":"8 Android","reply_to":877911653,"postdatetimestamp":1786284276},"16":{"pid":877916907,"fid":436,"tid":47341103,"authorid":4477571,"type":0,"score":2,"score_2":0,"recommend":0,"postdate":"2026-08-09 22:05","subject":"","alterinfo":"","content":"不就是想把华子也变成买办呗，高通少赚了吗","lou":16,"content_length":40,"from_client":"0 /","postdatetimestamp":1786284322},"17":{"pid":877917007,"fid":436,"tid":47341103,"authorid":67220628,"type":0,"score":0,"score_2":0,"recommend":0,"postdate":"2026-08-09 22:06","subject":"","alterinfo":"","content":"[quote][pid=877910766,47341103,1]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=43308954]麻烦提拉[/uid] (2026-08-09 20:41):[/b]<br/><br/>要不你替高通把5g专利费交一下？[/quote]<br/>阿为为啥回来2年3代没5G？他该把专利费交给谁？","lou":17,"content_length":49,"reply_to":877910766,"from_client":"0 /","postdatetimestamp":1786284405},"18":{"pid":877917008,"fid":436,"tid":47341103,"authorid":61916153,"type":0,"score":0,"score_2":0,"recommend":0,"postdate":"2026-08-09 22:06","subject":"","alterinfo":"","content":"不是华为，谁还要680，778这种垃圾？高通应该感谢华为","lou":18,"content_length":50,"from_client":"100 /","postdatetimestamp":1786284406},"19":{"pid":877918623,"fid":436,"tid":47341103,"authorid":34256587,"type":0,"score":0,"score_2":0,"recommend":0,"postdate":"2026-08-09 22:28","subject":"","alterinfo":"","content":"[quote][pid=877916849,47341103,1]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=163212]叛逆小天[/uid] (2026-08-09 22:04):[/b]<br/><br/>你是不是没脑子啊？高通基带不用华为的5g专利？[/quote]<br/><br/>高通是2g-4g基础专利多，华为是5g专利更多些，这2家专利费互相授权的，各自价值多少是谈判来的。当年专利费是还在谈判中，但是华为被制裁后没u可用了，所以紧急妥协，以给高通18亿美金为代价换来高通的4g高端U搭配低端U搭配熬过那段时间。","lou":19,"content_length":226,"reply_to":877916849,"from_client":"0 /","postdatetimestamp":1786285727}},"__T":{"fid":436,"tid":47341103,"topic_misc":"","subject":"华为和高通是竞争对手把我看笑了，华为不是高低要给高通磕一个才对","locked":0,"recommend":0,"quote_to":"","quote_from":0,"type":32,"replies":24,"authorid":65583054,"postdate":1786277559,"lastpost":1786290243,"jdata":"","author":"znen766","lastposter":"没有人比我更懂营销了","d